{
 "name": "devarena-watch-input",
 "about": "Watch-mode e2e of the player's hands in the Dev Arena (user report 2026-10-21: the mouse did nothing). Same setup as devarena/arena, then the shim hand-off with focus kept (a player who clicked into the window), and every kbm binding of res/controls_default.cfg pressed with posted mouse messages and the shim's SDL keys: the aim follows the mouse in four directions, and each of mouse_left/right/4/5, 1/2/3, q/e/v and space casts its skill (skill1, ran_mark, is TargetAOE: the press shows the marker and a left click places it, as in the game), r drinks, f uses, WASD move (da-inputlog, mods/devarena/scripts/HWP/DevArena/InputLog.as). \"on reset\" is a test cheat (mana refilled, cooldowns zeroed every frame, so presses can run back to back); while it is on, a red all-caps banner says so at the top of the screen, and the warning goes to the log and the chat. Posted messages stand in for the hardware; the OS foreground is never taken. Run: python -m gamelab run devarena/watch-input --mode watch.",
 "fixture": "mission-ranger",
 "mods": [
  "core",
  "devarena",
  "spec-ranger-test"
 ],
 "timeout": 900,
 "steps": [
  {
   "do": "gl",
   "verb": "mission",
   "args": [
    "dark_citadel",
    13,
    "seed=4242",
    "ngp=0"
   ],
   "expect": {
    "ok": true
   },
   "name": "setup: dark_citadel floor 13"
  },
  {
